@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 230
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
skinparam noteBorderColor #C9A227
participant "Admin device" as A
participant "Partition leader" as L
participant "Members table\n(same Raft group)" as M
participant "Log" as K
participant "Delivery worker" as W
participant "New member's phone" as N
A -> L : POST /members {user N}
L -> L : next seq = 5000
L -> M : one Raft entry: member row with\njoin_seq = 5000 + event MEMBER_ADDED at 5000
L --> A : 200 {joinSeq: 5000}
M -> K : MemberChanged, seq 5000
K -> W : invalidate members:{conv}
W -> N : MSG seq 5000 (you were added)
N -> L : history read before seq 5000
L --> N : 403: below join_seq
note over L, W : A removal is the same entry with left_seq. Until the cached members set\nexpires a removed member may get a few more pushes, so sync and history\nalways check the table, and for a sensitive group the push waits for the change.
@enduml
